functions to query CONFIG_ARM_COMPATIBLE_SEMIHOSTING at runtime.

Reviewed-by: Richard Henderson <richard.henderson@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Pierrick Bouvier <pierrick.bouvier@linaro.org>
---
